   "step": "做法第 3 步",
   "fact": "Stack 的子组件按声明顺序依次入栈，后声明的子组件渲染层级更高、覆盖前面的子组件；写在头图之后的内容层设了不透明背景就会盖住头图",
   "source": "https://gitcode.com/openharmony/docs/blob/master/zh-cn/application-dev/reference/apis-arkui/arkui-ts/ts-container-stack.md，Stack",
   "kind": "鸿蒙接口",
   "origin": "沿用并复核"
  },
  {
   "step": "做法第 2 步",
   "fact": "安卓 View.INVISIBLE 不可见但仍占布局空间，View.GONE 不可见且不占布局空间；ArkUI Visibility.Hidden 隐藏但参与布局占位，Visibility.None 隐藏且不占位",
   "source": "android.view.View#INVISIBLE；android.view.View#GONE；https://gitcode.com/openharmony/docs/blob/master/zh-cn/application-dev/reference/apis-arkui/arkui-ts/ts-appendix-enums.md，Visibility",
   "kind": "安卓平台",
   "origin": "沿用并复核"
  }
